 Labor Issues https://t.co/LFWtBNlTli from @CDT","url":"https://x.com/niubi/status/2112233537067786698"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112218135524757504"]},"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112229258122641639"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/aNMXZqeT2g","end":146,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/business/status/2112227405943234567/video/1","media_key":"13_2112218135524757504","start":123,"url":"https://t.co/aNMXZqeT2g"}]},"id":"2112229258122641639","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":27921,"like_count":115,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":7},"text":"You should come to an Odd Lots LIVE show sometime, because in addition to having great guests, we really have a great set. https://t.co/aNMXZqeT2g","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112229258122641639"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112229050915995821"],"id":"2112229050915995821","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":51283,"like_count":543,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":15},"text":"I saw an ad for some politician on here (I forget who) and he said his number one issue was affordability, and that if elected he would ban Congressional stock trading and keep rural hospitals open. Contemporary politicians will just insult your intelligence every chance they get","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112229050915995821"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:02:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112227821666062725"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":100,"id":"2198489827","start":87,"username":"drwconvexity"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/business/statu…","end":149,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/business/status/2112227405943234567","start":126,"url":"https://t.co/X6ZAymCTCc"}]},"id":"2112227821666062725","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":15999,"like_count":76,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":6},"text":"This was really the perfect guest and the perfect timing. It's been really fun pulling @drwconvexity into the Odd Lots orbit. https://t.co/X6ZAymCTCc","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112227821666062725"},{"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:34:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112220891216044421"],"id":"2112220891216044421","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":28864,"like_count":472,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":3},"text":"It's been a longtime since AI twitter has lost their minds over a new Chinese model. Seems like we're due","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112220891216044421"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112220477691183105"]},"author_id":"3039504459","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:33:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112220480249733122"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"An experiment resolves the tiny momentum transferred from an individual gas molecule to a levitated nanoparticle.","display_url":"go.aps.org/4yXKaKD","end":251,"expanded_url":"https://go.aps.org/4yXKaKD","images":[{"height":200,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112220482657226752/H1ai3BVj?format=png&name=orig","width":200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112220482657226752/H1ai3BVj?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":228,"status":200,"title":"Optomechanical Detection of Individual Gas Collisions","unwound_url":"https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/xtzh-6t1f","url":"https://t.co/Rl3USYDogn"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Azjlv7efiI","end":275,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2112220480249733122/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112220477691183105","start":252,"url":"https://t.co/Azjlv7efiI"}]},"id":"2112220480249733122","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":2702,"like_count":50,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":15},"text":"Researchers have detected individual collisions of Kr, Xe, and SF6 with an optically levitated nanoparticle, validating theoretical predictions and providing a proof-of-principle for primary pressure sensor designs.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/Rl3USYDogn https://t.co/Azjlv7efiI","url":"https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2112220480249733122"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112219981261713408"]},"author_id":"48463418","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:31:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112219985992876238"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"We revisit well-established mechanisms for primordial black hole (PBH) production, namely inflation, phase transitions, and cosmic strings, in the context of the dark dimension scenario, which is motivated by swampland principles. Applying quantum gravity constraints, we demonstrate that any viable mechanism, barring exotic new physics at low energies, inevitably leads to the formation of five-dimensional PBHs. We further show that PBHs formed from cosmic strings can have lifetimes comparable to the age of the Universe. We comment on the observational implications of this result, including a potential connection to the recent detection of a high-energy neutrino by KM3NeT, whose energy is intriguingly close to the five-dimensional Planck scale in the dark dimension scenario.","display_url":"go.aps.org/4ikEbto","end":251,"expanded_url":"https://go.aps.org/4ikEbto","start":228,"status":200,"title":"Primordial black holes are five dimensional","unwound_url":"https://journals.aps.org/prd/abstract/10.1103/g12h-93th","url":"https://t.co/GfAfmoWtjq"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KckHm2DZAl","end":275,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/APSphysics/status/2112219985992876238/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112219981261713408","start":252,"url":"https://t.co/KckHm2DZAl"}]},"id":"2112219985992876238","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":12500,"like_count":60,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":17},"text":"A study in Physical Review D re-analyzes different mechanisms for primordial black hole formation under the dark dimension scenario and finds that, if these cosmic objects exist, they would be five dimensional.\n\nRead the study: https://t.co/GfAfmoWtjq https://t.co/KckHm2DZAl","url":"https://x.com/APSphysics/status/2112219985992876238"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112216667447001088"]},"author_id":"14096763","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112216776931242443"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/zcijyLTort","end":137,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112216776931242443/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112216667447001088","start":114,"url":"https://t.co/zcijyLTort"}]},"id":"2112216776931242443","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":21132,"like_count":99,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":10},"text":"No real surprised, I suppose, but Le Spread is blowing out of its recent range. Also the Cac-40 fell 1.11% today. https://t.co/zcijyLTort","url":"https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2112216776931242443"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112214393098227712"]},"author_id":"3512101","created_at":"2026-10-19T16:08:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112214396453654840"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Surging wholesale costs squeeze suppliers across southern China, with Guangxi’s power retailers facing 5 billion yuan in projected losses","display_url":"caixinglobal.com/2026-10-19/cov…","end":96,"expanded_url":"https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-19/cover-story-chinas-power-retailers-reel-as-cheap-deals-backfire-102494733.html?cxg=web&Sfrom=twitter","images":[{"height":373,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112214400538972161/JIsFOjlj?format=jpg&name=orig","width":560},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112214400538972161/JIsFOjlj?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":73,"status":200,"title":"Cover Story: China’s Power Retailers Reel as Cheap Deals Backfire","unwound_url":"https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-19/cover-story-chinas-power